## Decision (Dean, 2026-08-06)

The two open design questions D1/D2 — whether `votingResults` and the per-variant **(b)-fallback**
should gate on `Enabled && Live` rather than `Enabled` alone (i.e. close the **scale-up Live-flag
gap**: a dead-but-enabled analyzer can currently still drive scale-up; the scale-DOWN veto is
already Live-gated and safe) — are **deferred to PR-2** (`ta-anchor-dynamic-refresh`).

This **answers** the open question raised in `plan__ta-anchor-voting-liveness-gate.md`: the answer
is "not in PR-1 — schedule for PR-2."

